          <li><a href="#best-collab-wanderlog">#2 — Wanderlog (Best Collaborative Itinerary)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-reviews-tripadvisor">#3 — TripAdvisor (Best Reviews + AI Trip Builder)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-itinerary-utripla">#4 — UTripla (Best AI Itinerary Generator)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-copilot-chatgpt">#5 — ChatGPT &amp; AI Assistants (Best Research Copilot)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#choosing-your-stack">Choosing Your Planner</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
        </ol>
